{%- doc -%}
  HSA/FSA eligibility verdict for the PDP quiet line. THE single source of
  truth for this line. Outputs exactly one of three literal strings:

    none      show nothing at all
    lmn       eligible, requires a letter of medical necessity
    eligible  eligible outright, no letter

  Usage (Liquid cannot return values, so capture it):

    {%- capture hsa -%}{%- render 'bbhsa-verdict', product: product, variant: variant -%}{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- assign hsa = hsa | strip -%}
    {%- if hsa != 'none' -%} ... {%- endif -%}

  @param {object} product - required
  @param {object} variant - optional, defaults to the selected/first available

  DATA CONTRACT, TWO SOURCES, IN ORDER. A product with no verdict from
  either source below renders nothing, not a guess.

    1. The production per-VARIANT metafield:
         redohsa.hsa_eligibility  "eligible" | "eligible_with_lmn" | "not_eligible"
       "not_eligible" -> none, unconditionally. "eligible_with_lmn" -> lmn.
       "eligible" -> eligible (plain, no letter). Blank/absent/any other
       value -> fall to source 2.

    2. The clinical-review metafields (per-VARIANT):
         gale_payments.gale_eligibility   "1" eligible | "0" not eligible | absent/other = no verdict
         gale_payments.gale_product_type  "dual_purpose" = letter of medical necessity required
       "0" -> none. "1" -> lmn when dual_purpose, else eligible.

    NOTE: sampled live via Admin GraphQL against 30 unique ACTIVE products
    (61 variant reads across two passes) on this store (2026-09-10):
    gale_eligibility is a binary "0"/"1" string here, never the three-tier
    eligible/lmn/not_eligible spelling. redohsa.hsa_eligibility read null
    on every sampled variant -- source 1 is dark on this merchant today;
    every live verdict currently resolves through source 2. This snippet
    still checks source 1 first so a future redohsa stamp is honored
    without a code change.

  EXCLUSIONS, checked before either metafield source: gift cards.

  A handle with no verdict from either source is silent, not guessed.
{%- enddoc -%}

{%- liquid
  assign _v = variant | default: product.selected_or_first_available_variant
  assign _out = 'none'

  assign _excluded = false
  if product.gift_card or product.type == 'Gift Card'
    assign _excluded = true
  endif

  unless _excluded
    assign _redo = _v.metafields.redohsa.hsa_eligibility.value | default: '' | strip

    if _redo == 'not_eligible'
      assign _out = 'none'
    elsif _redo == 'eligible_with_lmn'
      assign _out = 'lmn'
    elsif _redo == 'eligible'
      assign _out = 'eligible'
    else
      assign _gale = _v.metafields.gale_payments.gale_eligibility.value | default: '' | strip
      assign _gtype = _v.metafields.gale_payments.gale_product_type.value | default: '' | strip

      if _gale == '0'
        assign _out = 'none'
      elsif _gale == '1'
        if _gtype == 'dual_purpose'
          assign _out = 'lmn'
        else
          assign _out = 'eligible'
        endif
      else
        assign _out = 'none'
      endif
    endif
  endunless

  echo _out
-%}
